# Small modules

- Keep packages and functions small, with a single clear responsibility.
- Prefer splitting into focused files over growing one large file.
- Keep **providers** (match context → suggestions) separate from the **TUI** (render label/detail/value) and the **CLI entry**.
- Extract helpers when a unit does more than one job (parse cmdline, walk dirs, read `package.json`, fuzzy filter).
